      "writtenOn": "2022-03-29T22:47:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`#if` should be used for kconfig values, since they will always be defined and set to either 0 or 1: the `#ifdef`s I changed here were difficult to reason about because they were using the legacy code\u0027s config symbol that is either defined with no value or undefined, so I changed them to use the equivalent kconfig symbol.",
